{
    "title": "Crunchtime Teamworx",
    "description": "Teamworx by Crunchtime is the best restaurant scheduling app to manage your work schedules in one place. \r\n\r\n**NEW VERSION AVAILABLE**\r\nUpdate your app to enjoy faster page loading times and a more user-friendly navigation.\r\n\r\nEasily manage your restaurant\u2019s staff schedules on the go, all while ensuring proper coverage and minimizing scheduling conflicts. Whether you need to fill a shift or reassign a task, you can accomplish it all effortlessly through the Teamworx mobile app.\r\n\r\nKEY FEATURES: \r\n\r\nSHIFT SWAPPING FOR RESTAURANT EMPLOYEES \r\n\u2022  Post available shifts and pick up other available shifts   \r\n\u2022  Easily trade shifts with coworkers  \r\n\u2022  Managers can approve or deny shift changes\r\n\u2022  \r\n\r\nCOMMUNICATE WITH RESTAURANT STAFF\r\n\u2022  Distribute schedules instantly when published \r\n\u2022  Managers can easily send message team members \r\n\u2022  Send bulk communication from corporate  \r\n\r\nREAL-TIME DATA & ALERTS FOR RESTAURANT MANAGERS\r\n\u2022  Alert notifications about overtime and other risks \r\n\u2022  Alert notifications about upcoming breaks\r\n\u2022  Easily view the employee roster during shifts \r\n\r\n NOTE: Use of Teamworx requires a subscription to Crunchtime.",
    "descriptionHTML": "Teamworx by Crunchtime is the best restaurant scheduling app to manage your work schedules in one place. <br><br>**NEW VERSION AVAILABLE**<br>Update your app to enjoy faster page loading times and a more user-friendly navigation.<br><br>Easily manage your restaurant\u2019s staff schedules on the go, all while ensuring proper coverage and minimizing scheduling conflicts. Whether you need to fill a shift or reassign a task, you can accomplish it all effortlessly through the Teamworx mobile app.<br><br>KEY FEATURES: <br><br>SHIFT SWAPPING FOR RESTAURANT EMPLOYEES <br>\u2022  Post available shifts and pick up other available shifts   <br>\u2022  Easily trade shifts with coworkers  <br>\u2022  Managers can approve or deny shift changes<br>\u2022  <br><br>COMMUNICATE WITH RESTAURANT STAFF<br>\u2022  Distribute schedules instantly when published <br>\u2022  Managers can easily send message team members <br>\u2022  Send bulk communication from corporate  <br><br>REAL-TIME DATA &amp; ALERTS FOR RESTAURANT MANAGERS<br>\u2022  Alert notifications about overtime and other risks <br>\u2022  Alert notifications about upcoming breaks<br>\u2022  Easily view the employee roster during shifts <br><br> NOTE: Use of Teamworx requires a subscription to Crunchtime.",
